      "verdict": "correct",
      "target": "No se pudo obtener la información de los episodios. Inténtalo de nuevo.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "reason": "'Capturada' is an unnatural translation for 'fetched' in this context (should be 'obtenida'). 'Episodio' should be lowercase. 'Inténtalo' is more natural than 'inténtelo' in modern UI contexts unless strict formal register is required, but 'obtenida' is the critical fix."
