      "target": "Vuelve a obtener las temporadas y episodios sin cambiar tu selección de reproducción.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "reason": "'Traiga' is an unnatural command form for 'Fetch' in this context (should be 'Obtén' or 'Vuelve a obtener'). 'Estaciones' is a mistranslation of 'seasons' (TV series) as 'stations' (radio/TV broadcast stations). 'Temporadas' is the correct term."
